Takes a fetch report for a want in any state again, as before "Take a
fetch report only for a want that is fetching":
WantList::fetched checks only the report's version, so a late report for
a want whose commit is in flight sets it wanted again, and the next
dispatch starts a second commit of the path while the first is still in
flight (DESIGN.md §7.5). The simulator's check for commits in flight then
fails the run.

test: delocal-sim regressions::a_late_fetch_report_starts_no_second_commit
test: delocal-engine want::tests::a_fetch_report_for_a_want_that_is_not_fetching_changes_nothing

